{"slug":"Universal-Script-Network-Owned-parts-visualizer-49492","_id":"68a707c51047f74e8f43fe9f","title":"Network Owned parts visualizer","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Shows every\nNetWorkOwned part, and every unachored part (optional)\ntrue means On\nfalse means Off\n(Gotta explain to the skids)\nI have found this vulnerability while looking through roblox api :D\nAlso do not turn both true(on) atleast have one set to false","tags":["NetworkOwnerShip","part visualizer","Unac*d visualizer","part debugging","Unac*d Part"],"script":"--// by https or krnl.nan\n\n--// for a / b and c only one should be *true*, and other's false\n--// expect for d it can be true even a other one is on\n\n--// Settings //--\n\nlocal a = true --// this will make every network owned part highlighted\n\nlocal b = false --// this will make every Unachored part highlighted\n\nlocal c = false --// its like *a* but it shows EVERYONE'S (including you) NetWorked Owned parts\n\nlocal d = false --// this will show everyone's SimulationRadius (including you)\n--// having d \"true\" will show circles, note this setting can be true even if a other one is on\n--// SimulationRadius if you dont know it its basically a hidden Object that if a unachored part touches it, it will be NetworkOwned\n\n--// Script //-- (ignore)\nsettings():GetService(\"PhysicsSettings\").AreAwakePartsHighlighted = a\nsettings():GetService(\"PhysicsSettings\").AreNonAnchorsShown = b\nsettings():GetService(\"PhysicsSettings\").AreOwnersShown = c\nsettings():GetService(\"PhysicsSettings\").AreRegionsShown = d","owner":{"_id":"6767d4cfef671e5dfd9c7a6f","username":"Https","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/1992900c023950b81a16f2f1715b2f9d47bd01e12412c0bd49685b06770cf34e